,0:02:55.93,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The voice inside of meComment: 0,0:02:55.93,0:03:01.33,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,keeps sustaining meComment: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:06.47,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Wicked rain will get in my wayComment: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:11.41,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,But I won't walk awayComment: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:16.85,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's goComment: 0,0:03:16.85,0:03:20.15,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without stoppingComment: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:25.42,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without giving up to the flow of timeComment: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:31.06,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'll keep getting back upComment: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:36.43,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Because I don't want to lose something preciousComment: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:42.14,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,To the future I believe in...Comment: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.31,Ace,,0,0,0,Code once,mau = Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Ace,,0,0,0,Code once,smoke = Comment: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.31,Ace,,0,0,0,Template char noblank loop 20,!retime("syl",0,700+($si-1)*20)!!smoke[math.random(3)]!Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Ace,,0,0,0,code syl all,function charşcounter(ref) ci[ref] = ci[ref] + 1; return "" endComment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Ace,,0,0,0,code line all,ci = ; cn = _G.unicode.len(orgline.textşstripped:gsub(" ",""))Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Ace,,0,0,0,code once,temp = Comment: 1,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.31,Ace,,0,0,0,template noblank,!retime("syl",-25,500)!Comment: 1,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.31,Ace,lead-in(text),0,0,0,template char noblank loop 10,!charşcounter(2)!!retime("start2syl",-900+(ci[2]-1)*5,0)!Comment: 0,0:23:45.74,0:23:48.55,Ace,,0,0,0,karaoke,Flame FenceDialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:10.32,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A newborn child bears no sin.Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Garp.Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:15.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Take care of my child.Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:20.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Your father is...Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:25.47,Main,,0,0,0,,the Pirate King, Gold Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:43.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist Ace... is Gold Roger's son?!Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.67,0:00:51.06,Main,,0,0,0,,This is huge news!Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:53.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Call the main office right away! We're releasing an extra for this!Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.87,Main,,0,0,0,,So, it still lives...Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The...Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.18,0:01:12.98,Main,,0,0,0,,The blood of the Pirate King lives on!Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:50.30,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing/Title Card SewilDialogue: 0,0:01:50.78,0:01:55.64,Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Assurance Galaxy 9000 PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:02:02.21,Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke & Attack Effects KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:06.10,Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.91,0:02:09.53,Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:15.63,Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation YibisDialogue: 0,0:02:17.48,0:02:20.40,Credits,,0,0,0,,Raw Provider CloaknsmokeDialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:56.30,Title,,0,0,230,,Ace and WhitebeardDialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:07.86,Main,,0,0,0,,So, he isn't Luffy's real brother?Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:16.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger's...Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:18.20,Main,,0,0,0,,son?Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:27.91,Main,,0,0,0,,So his biological son lives on? What a miracle.Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:32.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyone who had a connection to Roger back then should have already been executed!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:38.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Since he's Luffy-san's brother, I assumed Dragon was his father, too...Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.39,0:04:41.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought so too! What's going on here?Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.49,0:04:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Does this mean they aren't really brothers?Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you believe this, Garp?Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:52.93,Main,,0,0,0,,A child's about to be born...Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,...My child.Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:05:01.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I'll have left this world by the time that happens.Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:07.09,Main,,0,0,0,,And why are you telling this to me, a marine?Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:08.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:13.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The mother of that child, and any woman with ties to you, will undoubtedly be executed!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:19.23,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm telling you.Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:28.31,Main,,0,0,0,,The Government is sure to figure out where I've been this past year.Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll find her, and then they'll kill her.Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:35.55,Main,,0,0,0,,But... a newborn child bears no sin.Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:42.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp! You and I have nearly killed each other countless times.Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.01,0:05:48.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I trust you as much as I would a member of my own crew!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:00.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Protect him for me.Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:04.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't try that selfish crap on me!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.65,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I know you'll do it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care of my child!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:49.09,Main,,0,0,0,,And you're sure this is the island?Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:54.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger was spotted here, but he was behaving differently.Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:57.10,Main,,0,0,0,,He was acting almost like a father.Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:59.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger's era is over.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We must eradicate all traces of his bloodline.Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.67,0:07:08.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Investigate every child born during the ten months following his imprisonment.Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:17.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Investigate all pregnant women, as well.Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:23.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Kill any mother who seems suspicious.Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Five children were born this month.Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:27.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The following are expected to give birth next month...Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:38.03,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Not yet.Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:44.31,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You can't be born yet.Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:50.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:54.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Not yet.Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:59.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Not yet.Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:05.86,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Not yet... Not yet...Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:25.64,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're a girl, your name will be Ann.Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:30.93,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're a boy, it'll be Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:34.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are the names he chose.Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:40.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Our child's name is Gol D. Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:53.87,Main,,0,0,0,,This is our child.Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:09:59.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Rouge!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Rouge! Hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.45,0:10:12.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You take care of him, Dadan!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,No way...!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.73,0:10:19.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Whose kid is that?Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Dadan?Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:27.90,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. From now on, this is where you'll be living.Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:29.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.97,0:10:33.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You're going to be living with these guys. Try to get along with them.Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:41.32,Main,,0,0,0,,As annoying as it is,Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,both me and Luffy carry the blood of a world-renowned criminal.Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:49.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though I owe my mother a debt of gratitude and took the name "Portgas"...Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.49,0:10:53.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I still can't stand the thought that I carry the blood of that worthless father of mine.Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:56.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps...Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,My old man is...Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard. And no one else.Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:09.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp...Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been two years now, hasn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:17.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Since you took the name of your mother, formed the Spade Pirates,Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.83,0:11:23.26,Main,,0,0,0,,and ventured to the seas with formidable strength and speed.Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:26.43,Main,,0,0,0,,At that point, we finally realized...Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:30.40,Main,,0,0,0,,...that we had not stopped Roger's bloodline!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:42.02,Main,,0,0,0,,But Whitebeard, who realized this truth at the same time as us,Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.02,0:11:45.64,Main,,0,0,0,,decided to raise you to become the next Pirate King,Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:49.70,Main,,0,0,0,,and let the son of his former rival on to his own ship!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:53.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not true!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:56.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I got on that ship so I could make the old man the Pirate King!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who thinks that!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:03.31,Main,,0,0,0,,We were careful not to act recklessly...Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:06.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You were under Whitebeard's protection!Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:13.51,Main,,0,0,0,,But left unchecked, you'd undoubtedly inspire a new generation of pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That is why your execution here today carries such great significance.Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:26.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if we must go to war against Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.97,0:12:36.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:38.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Reporting in!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:41.31,Main,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice are opening, but nobody's ordered them to!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.31,0:12:44.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't get in touch with the control room, either!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,They opened!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice are opening on their own!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't the Navy say they wouldn't open it for us?Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:17.80,Main,,0,0,0,,The control room is most likely inside Marineford. Who could have done this?Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Here it comes! It is time!Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:27.50,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Captain Buggy, it can't be...!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:29.95,Main,,0,0,0,,The time has come!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:31.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me, you're...!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I never realized you were actually God's messenger!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:36.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously?! Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.27,0:13:39.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course it's not true! There must be some sort of trick here!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:44.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's right... Who the hell opened the Gate?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:49.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No...! Could Heaven itself want to make me the Pirate King?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.59,0:13:56.42,Main,,0,0,0,,They're here!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:58.72,Main,,0,0,0,,All troops, prepare for battle!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.69,0:14:10.50,Main,,0,0,0,,They appeared so suddenly! But where did they come from?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.79,0:14:23.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a huge fleet of pirate ships!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:26.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is Whitebeard? Find him!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:29.18,Main,,0,0,0,,"Bohemian Knight" Doma!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:30.45,Main,,0,0,0,,"Thunder Lord" McGuy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.78,Main,,0,0,0,,The DeCalvan Brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:35.02,Main,,0,0,0,,"Whirl Spider" Squard!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:41.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Every one of these mighty figures... They're all captains renowned throughout the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.60,Main,,0,0,0,,There are forty-three ships in total.Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard and his commanders are nowhere to be found.Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.47,0:14:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,But these pirates are definitely allied with Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you see Ace-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:54.78,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is! Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get thrown off by this! You're all hopeless!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys...?Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:06.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we attack them?Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:10.45,Main,,0,0,0,,No, wait. Whitebeard's must be around here somewhere!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:14.20,Main,,0,0,0,,He's waiting for the right moment. Watch the water!Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:19.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Now it's getting interesting! I'm really getting excited here!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and show up, Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.59,0:15:40.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It can't be!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is he coming from?Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.79,0:15:53.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, he sure picked one amazing place to show up.Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,We never considered this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:08.49,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a shadow beneath the surface!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:09.65,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:21.14,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's how they did it?Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.14,0:16:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,They coated their entire fleet and came here along the bottom of the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:45.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Moby Dick!Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:04.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Three more of Whitebeard's ships have appeared!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,They've broken into the bay!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:15.41,Main,,0,0,0,,T-That's...Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:17.95,Main,,0,0,0,,The commander of the First Division, Marco!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:23.76,Main,,0,0,0,,All 14 commanders are here!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:54.22,Main,,0,0,0,,How long has it been, Sengoku?Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:56.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:59.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I take it my beloved son...Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:02.33,Main,,0,0,0,,is still doing well?Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:16.78,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you get in here so easily...?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.48,0:18:24.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Vwe've made it past the gates!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Now then, Vi wonder if vyou and Ace-boy's father will show up.Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.33,0:18:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's father?Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:37.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Since his son Ace is about to be executed, Vi'm sure Dragon will do something!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:40.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, me and Ace don't have the same dad.Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,My dad is Dragon...Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,but Ace's dad is Gold Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:48.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:52.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I never got to meet him, but I hear he's pretty amazing.Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:55.11,Main,,0,0,0,,But Ace gets mad whenever I say that.Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:56.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:58.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. That's supposed to be a secret.Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:19:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.23,0:19:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait just a little longer, Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:24.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Old man!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:45.27,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What?Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.27,0:19:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,A crack... in the air?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:19:59.97,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of blast is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:02.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Not good! Look at the size of that wave!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.61,0:20:06.52,Main,,0,0,0,,A seaquake?! He can make even the oceans shake?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:08.72,Main,,0,0,0,,There's one on the other side, too!Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this Whitebeard's power?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.09,0:20:16.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm going on ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:23.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.27,0:20:25.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure! So long, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:31.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! When I set out to sea in three years, I'll have gotten even stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.71,0:20:32.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.35,0:20:36.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:47.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go cause some trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,That kid...! He went and became a pirate?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.86,0:20:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,A pirate ship! It's a flag I've never seen before!Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:06.64,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a pirate who's been growing in strength recently.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,D...? Where is he from?Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:14.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't know yet, but he's a rookie who wields the power of a Logia Devil Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.51,0:21:20.47,Main,,0,0,0,,A kid with some strength has shown up in the Grand Line!Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems he turned down an offer to join the Seven Warlords.Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:28.22,Main,,0,0,0,,How old are these kids?Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:30.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do the young ones always have to be in such a hurry?Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Captain?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:36.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to meet him, no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:38.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Red-Haired Shanks!Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The Spade Pirates?Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:47.19,Main,,0,0,0,,The famous Super Rookies... have come for me?Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.19,0:21:49.84,Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I'm here for!Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:53.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved my little brother's life. He always talks about you.Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.69,0:21:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to thank you in person.Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.13,0:21:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.27,0:22:00.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I never knew he had a brother!Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:03.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. I'm glad you came!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:05.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me more!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's have a party!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, big guy! I wanna meet this Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:20.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to allow a kid with murderous intent to see the old man!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:22.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain! That's Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.75,0:22:25.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? One of the Seven Warlords?Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:28.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that's gonna be a problem.Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I may not be a member of the Whitebeard Pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.17,0:22:35.27,Main,,0,0,0,,but I feel it is my duty to face you!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been five days, and they're still fighting!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.25,0:22:51.65,Main,,0,0,0,,They might both die at this rate!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.29,0:23:06.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:15.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:20.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's the kid who wants to take my head?Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.11,0:23:27.42,Main,,0,0,0,,As you wish, I'll take you on!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:30.82,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Whitebeard Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.69,0:23:34.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this myself.Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.34,0:23:44.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:52.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain! Captain Ace, what are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:54.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Run, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.21,0:23:56.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.85,0:24:01.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What? You're gonna run away now?Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.52,0:24:03.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm letting my crew escape.Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:06.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm staying in their place. I won't run!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.49,0:24:10.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What a cheeky little brat you are!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.38,0:24:23.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.28,0:24:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You still tryin' to stand up?Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.48,0:24:34.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to see you die here, kid.Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.61,0:24:36.43,Main,,0,0,0,,If you still want to fight,Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.43,0:24:41.26,Main,,0,0,0,,then take my name and roam the seas wild and free!Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.90,0:24:47.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Become my son!Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.70,0:24:50.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.75,0:25:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the commander of the Fourth Division... Thatch!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.50,0:25:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Since you're joining our crew,Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.87,0:25:05.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I think we should be friends.Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.15,0:25:06.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.90,0:25:10.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure woke up in a bad mood.Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.99,0:25:14.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Do you want to know what happened after you passed out?Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.47,0:25:21.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Your companions came to get you back... so we beat them all.Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.87,0:25:26.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What? It's not like they're dead. We're keeping them here on this ship.Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.89,0:25:30.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you should leave me like this, without any locks or shackles or anything?Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.50,0:25:33.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Shackles? We don't need those!Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.79,0:25:58.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what d'ya think your doing?Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.45,0:26:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You should be more considerate at this time of night!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.41,0:26:17.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, he fell overboard!Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.40,0:26:18.60,Main,,0,0,0,,And he can't swim, either!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.60,0:26:20.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone, go save him!Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.73,0:26:27.68,Main,,0,0,0,,He does this every day. He has real persistence.Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.89,0:26:30.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Was that the hundredth time?Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.22,0:26:31.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I think so.Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.39,0:26:49.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys...Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.84,0:26:53.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you call him your father, anyway?Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.13,0:27:00.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Because he calls us his sons.Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.43,0:27:04.97,Main,,0,0,0,,To the rest of the world we're all just outcasts.Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.86,0:27:07.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It makes us happy.Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.86,0:27:12.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just a word, but it makes us happy!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.41,0:27:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, how long are you gonna keep risking your life like this?Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.67,0:27:27.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind already!Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.13,0:27:31.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to take pops' head in your current condition.Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.45,0:27:35.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna get off this ship and start over...Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.82,0:27:38.56,Main,,0,0,0,,or are you gonna stay here...Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.86,0:27:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,and take on Whitebeard's mark?Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.98,0:27:52.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You're Doma, right?Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.94,0:28:00.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! Ace did it again!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.23,0:28:03.26,Main,,0,0,0,,He made Doma's crew surrender, all on his own!Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.26,0:28:05.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, become the Second Division Commander?Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.73,0:28:08.80,Main,,0,0,0,,We've haven't had one for a long time.Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.80,0:28:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody would definitely accept you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.97,0:28:17.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You've been here a lot longer than I have, right? Are you sure it's okay?Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.64,0:28:20.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine, don't worry about it.Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.83,0:28:23.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have that kind of ambition anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.12,0:28:28.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Commander Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.92,0:28:35.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? What a surprise!Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.35,0:28:36.93,Main,,0,0,0,,So, that's how it is?Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.42,0:28:42.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't really act like Roger, though...Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.66,0:28:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he your enemy?Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.76,0:28:47.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna throw me out?Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.43,0:28:53.86,Main,,0,0,0,,When you said you had something  important to talk about, I thought it would be more important than this...Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.86,0:28:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who your parents were. Everyone is a child of the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:11.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like another incredible man has joined Whitebeard's crew.Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,They say he's unbelievably strong!Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.31,0:29:34.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Ace! Calm down!Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.22,0:29:37.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The old man said he'd make an exception, just this once!Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.17,0:29:38.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to chase after Teach!Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.89,0:29:41.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go! He was a member of my division!Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.99,0:29:46.45,Main,,0,0,0,,If I just ignore this, Thatch won't be able to rest in peace!Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.02,0:29:48.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.16,0:29:53.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine, just this once.Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.80,0:29:57.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a weird feeling about this.Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.13,0:30:00.34,Main,,0,0,0,,He killed a crewmate and escaped!Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.53,0:30:03.18,Main,,0,0,0,,After living under your protection for so many years...Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.18,0:30:05.55,Main,,0,0,0,,he just spat right in your face!Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.65,0:30:10.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Above all else, he tarnished his father's name.Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.50,0:30:12.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think I can just ignore that?Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.98,0:30:15.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll settle this!Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.93,0:30:23.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Come back, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.69,0:30:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.76,0:30:37.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Old man...Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.94,0:30:40.14,Main,,0,0,0,,All of you...Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.39,0:30:48.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I ignored your orders and ran off! Why didn't you just abandon me?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.76,0:30:50.99,Main,,0,0,0,,This only happened because I was so stubborn!Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.75,0:30:54.73,Main,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.77,0:31:01.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I was the one who told you to go...Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.77,0:31:04.36,Main,,0,0,0,,my son.Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.66,0:31:11.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You're lying! Don't be ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.41,0:31:13.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You tried to stop me back then, but I...!Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.99,0:31:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you to go!Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.26,0:31:27.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I told him to go. Isn't that right, Marco?Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.60,0:31:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard it too. We sent you into a lot of trouble, huh, Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.29,0:31:36.67,Main,,0,0,0,,This entire ocean should know...Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:40.21,Main,,0,0,0,,what happens when someone...Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.21,0:31:44.56,Main,,0,0,0,,harms one of our crewmates.Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.37,0:31:51.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyone who hurts you won't be allowed to live, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.41,0:31:53.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang on! We're coming for you, right now!Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.66,0:32:02.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves, Navy HQ!Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.01,0:32:11.91,Main,,0,0,0,,He's gathered quite an impressive group, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.91,0:32:15.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What are they going on about?Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.10,0:32:18.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling about this.Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.24,0:32:28.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What are these tremors?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.56,0:32:33.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Here it comes. The seaquake that he set off earlier...Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.26,0:32:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,is coming back as a tsunami!Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.37,0:32:44.94,Main,,0,0,0,,The earthquake man, who ate the Tremor-Tremor Fruit...Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.94,0:32:48.95,Main,,0,0,0,,"Whitebeard", Edward Newgate!Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.15,0:32:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.62,0:32:55.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a tsunami! It's huge!Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.62,0:33:00.41,Main,,0,0,0,,We might outnumber them, but don't assume that it guarantees our victory...Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.41,0:33:04.55,Main,,0,0,0,,It's possible that we will be the ones to meet our end!Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.55,0:33:06.10,Main,,0,0,0,,That man...Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.20,0:33:10.37,Main,,0,0,0,,has the power to destroy the world!Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.54,0:33:21.31,Main,,0,0,0,,It's starting...Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.31,0:33:22.74,Main,,0,0,0,,The war!Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.85,0:33:27.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.29,0:33:43.30,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard and his fleet of fourty-seven pirate ships from the New World are attacking.Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:46.17,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Standing against them are the Government's two greatest forces:Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.17,0:33:49.11,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Navy HQ and the Seven Royal Warlords of the Sea.Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.04,0:33:53.35,Narrator,,0,0,0,,No matter who the winner is... no matter who the loser is...Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.35,0:33:54.88,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the era will change.Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:46.86,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:46.86,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.74,0:01:45.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:46.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:01:44.82,0:01:45.68,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:01:44.82,0:01:45.68,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:44.82,0:01:45.68,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:47.08,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 1,0:01:44.90,0:01:45.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:47.27,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:44.98,0:01:46.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:44.98,0:01:46.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:47.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 1,0:01:45.06,0:01:46.50,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:01:45.06,0:01:46.50,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:01:45.06,0:01:46.50,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:47.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 1,0:01:45.14,0:01:46.85,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:45.14,0:01:46.85,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:45.14,0:01:46.85,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:48.25,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 1,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:48.40,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,soDialogue: 1,0:01:45.30,0:01:47.55,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:01:45.30,0:01:47.55,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:45.30,0:01:47.55,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.55,0:01:48.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,raDialogue: 1,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.72,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 1,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.72,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:49.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,woDialogue: 1,0:01:45.46,0:01:48.50,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:49.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.54,0:01:49.51,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:50.91,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:45.62,0:01:49.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:51.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:45.70,0:01:49.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:45.70,0:01:49.88,Kar